Changes made by JMusicBot-ML (summary; full list in CHANGELOG.md):
  - User interface, config.txt and console messages in 6 languages
    (English, Turkish, Japanese, German, Spanish, Russian)
  - Turkish command names
  - Rewritten Spotify support (track/album/playlist/artist links, no API key needed)
  - "Now playing" card with control buttons, previous-track history
  - Lyrics from LRCLIB, YouTube radio/mix expansion (up to 75 tracks)
  - yt-dlp download fallback, optional YouTube sign-in, cache and log size limits
  - Bug fixes (see CHANGELOG.md)

